### Performance budget

Until M1's optimization pass, a figure past its threshold or over its ceiling is noted and fails nothing (ADR 0134, as amended on 2026-10-22).

| Benchmark or entry | Figure | Base | Head | Change | Limit | Verdict |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
| goodfetch-engine/instructions::dispatch::hello | instructions | — | 500000 | — | +5% | new, not gated |
| goodfetch-frontier/heap::frontier::push | global-maximum-bytes | 8000 | 8000 | +0.00% | +5% | within |
| goodfetch-frontier/heap::frontier::push | total-allocations | 1000 | 1200 | +20.00% | +5% | over |
| goodfetch-frontier/heap::frontier::push | total-bytes | 64000 | 60000 | -6.25% | +5% | improved |
| goodfetch-frontier/instructions::frontier::push | instructions | 2000000 | 2010000 | +0.50% | +5% | within |
| size-limit/collie-client | brotli | 100.00 kB | 106.20 kB | +6.20 kB | +5 kB | accepted |
| size-limit/collie-console | brotli | 990.00 kB | 1000.40 kB | +10.40 kB | +5 kB, ≤ 1000.00 kB | over its ceiling |

